                "text": "Today, I introduced a comprehensive health care reform plan that combines over 75 bipartisan proposals to:\n\u2705Lower health care costs\n\u2705Increase the number of insured Americans\n\u2705Protect those with preexisting conditions\n\u2705Expand coverage options (1/3)\nhttps://t.co/j5atDvAb8y",
