                "text": "QALYs are a flawed measure used to put a dollar value on the lives of patients to determine if a treatment is cost-effective or not. I believe you can't put a price on human life, so I proudly voted YES on HR 485 to prohibit the use of QALYs and affirm that every life has value.",
